<<^ code=`&#x0001;` from=`?` to=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.approval.checks`>>
<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "check an approval's verdict over a file's bytes"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///realm.approval.checks", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.approval.checks"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.approval.checks"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.approval.checks ~ the verdict against this vault's charter head

`lares nexus approve check <approval> <file> [nexus=<aid>]` reads the verdict over the file's bytes against this vault's charter head; exit 0 only on ok.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ check

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`check` params=`approval/a.json file/manifest.json ~ check one approval`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ approval · file · nexus

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`approval` params=`takes/host-path needs/required seat/1 as/<approval> ~ the approval`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`file` params=`takes/host-path needs/required seat/2 as/<file> ~ the bytes`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/aid ~ the Nexus, by AID; absent, the primary charter's`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat-or-hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat-or-hand` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ reads the charter head; signs nothing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.approval.checks approval/a.json file/manifest.json]] ~ name the approval and the file`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ ok

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`ok` params=`exit/0 ~ the approval counts over these bytes`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares nexus approve check

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares nexus approve check]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~/ahu>>

